    "level": "restricted",
    "note": "No official current access statement found. A 2016 register visit report describes a steel square with a lock and chain on a floor below the cabin, meant to block future intruders. A 2026 guide says the park is open sunrise to sunset, that visitors willing to climb are rewarded with views from the top, and that the observer may invite visitors up into the cab when the tower is staffed. No official source confirms that visitors may climb it."
  },
